        "class": "DRIFT",
        "note": "in the source the corner bar is how an Ultra Beast is identified, full stop; the entry makes the marking conditional on another card's effect interacting with Ultra Beasts, which is not what the source says",
        "resolved": false,
        "severity": "low"
